    "project_purpose": "The OPEN Ticketing Ecosystem is a decentralized event ticketing protocol that enables event creation, ticket sales, and on-chain revenue distribution. It uses a modular architecture with factories, registries, and economic models to manage events and OPN-based ticketing fees or ecosystem fuel across multiple chains.",
